B.ZB=s(["Normally, a set is won by reaching exactly 50 points","If a turn limit is active, the highest score at the end of the limit wins the set","If the top score is tied, the set is a draw","The match winner is decided by the selected game mode",'The top left of the match screen shows the current set and the game mode, e.g. "SET 2  First to 3"',"You can add sets from the set result screen (first-to-2 becomes first-to-3, 10 sets becomes 12). Sets cannot be removed, but you can undo what you just added while that screen is open"],t.s)
